  "solution": "**Given**\n\n {{3} over 8} + [((4)/(8)div (2)/(3))times (8)/(5)+(3)/(10)] \n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/47485e25d1b30c57dc271863db8b99be0c8e209069b2596cc885911d898a8a78.png] \n\n**Calculation**\n\n⇒ {{3} over 8} + [((4)/(8)div (2)/(3))times (8)/(5)+(3)/(10)] \n\n⇒ {{3} over 8} + [((4)/(8)times (3)/(2))times (8)/(5)+(3)/(10)] \n\n⇒ {{3} over 8} + ((3)/(4)times (8)/(5)+(3)/(10)) \n\n⇒ {{3} over 8} + ((6)/(5)+(3)/(10)) \n\n⇒ {{3} over 8} + 15over 10 \n\n⇒ (15 + 60 )over 40 \n\n⇒ 75 over 40 \n\n⇒ 15 over 8 \n\n**∴ The required answer is __15/8__.**",
